name: ['Bladewing the Risen', 'Duress', 'Evolving Wilds', "Firemind's Research", 'Forest', 'Ghalta, Primal Hunger', "Hanna, Ship's Navigator", 'Island', 'Llanowar Elves', 'Mountain', 'Plains', 'Ral, Izzet Viceroy', 'Rhys the Redeemed', 'Snow-Covered Forest', 'Snow-Covered Island', 'Snow-Covered Mountain', 'Snow-Covered Plains', 'Snow-Covered Swamp', 'Swamp', 'Talrand, Sky Summoner', 'Teferi, Hero of Dominaria', 'The Gitrog Monster', 'Vraska, Golgari Queen']
